WEBVTT

00:14:27.766 --> 00:14:30.741
She tests a rock now against the wall.

00:14:30.765 --> 00:14:32.121
She needs to give it to us.

00:14:32.984 --> 00:14:35.000
And she gets cucumber again.

00:14:37.343 --> 00:14:43.799
(Laughter)

00:14:44.451 --> 00:14:47.580
So this is basically
the Wall Street protest that you see here.

00:14:47.604 --> 00:14:49.976
(Laughter)

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:54.253
(Applause)

00:14:54.277 --> 00:14:56.063
I still have two minutes left --

00:14:56.087 --> 00:14:58.050
let me tell you a funny story about this.

00:14:58.261 --> 00:15:01.871
This study became very famous
and we got a lot of comments,